# Cloudberry's isolation2_resgroup_v2_schedule (src/test/isolation2), as the
# port runs it on a coordinator and three segments, through the isolation2
# suite's harness: M6's resource groups, in the schedule's order.
#
#   run   the test runs here, in both passes; cloudberry/ holds a difference
#         reviewed and kept, where one pass has one.  The third word is the
#         group: each group's tests share a cluster and a cgroup parent of
#         their own, and run one at a time, in a job of its own (../jobs,
#         RG_GROUPS).  The group cpu has the test that keeps its cores busy
#         and measures what a group gets of them, which runs after the other
#         jobs (../jobs); the group cpuset the test that pins groups to cores
#         0 and 1 and looks where their processes run, whose own statements
#         are a superuser's, in admin_group at a tenth of the cores; "*" is
#         every group, resgroup_auxiliary_tools_v2, which turns resource
#         groups on.
#   skip  it needs what the port does not have yet: the rest of the line says
#         what
run  resgroup/resgroup_auxiliary_tools_v2  *
run  resgroup/resgroup_bypass_catalog  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_views  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_syntax  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_transaction  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_name_convention  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_bypass  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_assign_slot_fail  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_unassign_entrydb  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_concurrency  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_wait_time  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_alter_concurrency  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_cpu_max_percent  cpu
run  resgroup/resgroup_cpuset  cpuset
run  resgroup/resgroup_cpuset_empty_default  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_cancel_terminate_concurrency  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_memory_limit_resgroup_v2  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_move_query  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_io_limit  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_recreate  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_functions  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_pg_manage_resource_groups  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_dumpinfo  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_large_group_id  main
run  resgroup/resgroup_disable_resgroup  main
